{
    "agent": "industry/logfix_ai",
    "connections": ["direct"],
    "timeout_in_seconds": 300,
    "interactions": [
        {
            "text": """Analyze this sanitized log and create a support-ready incident response:
2026-09-02 10:15:22 ERROR OrderService
HikariPool-1 - Connection is not available, request timed out after 30000ms.
java.sql.SQLTransientConnectionException:
orders-db - Connection is not available, request timed out after 30000ms.
API /orders returned HTTP 500""",
            "response": {
                "text": {
                    "gist": """
The response should classify the OrderService incident as a database connection timeout, cite evidence from the
sanitized log, provide runbook-grounded safe checks, distinguish approval-required actions, and include a concise
stakeholder incident update.
"""
                }
            }
        }
    ]
}
